  "description": "Redis caching with the three invalidation patterns the platform uses: TTL for derived data,\n      event-driven eviction for entity caches, and versioned keys for reference data. Includes\n      stampede protection, stale-while-revalidate, negative caching, and a GEO index for live\n      worker positions.",
  "iconFile": "apple-touch-icon.png",
